        "body": "## Task Execution Complete\n\n**Task ID**: {{ $('Build Cursor Prompt').first().json.task_id }}\n**Status**: {{ $json.status }}\n\n### Validation Output\n```\n{{ $('Check Validation').first().json.validator_output }}\n```\n\n### Next Steps\n- [ ] Review generated output\n- [ ] Approve or request changes\n- [ ] Close this issue when done",
        "labels": ["review-required", "ai-generated"]
      },
